#: ../../source/isingq.rst:2
msgid "iSing cloud optimization"
msgstr "iSing 云端优化"

#: ../../source/isingq.rst:4
msgid ""
"Install ``quspect[isingq]`` to submit optimization models to iSing. This "
"backend accepts binary quadratic models and logical Ising problems; it "
"does not execute quantum circuits. The native extension is not required "
"for compilation or cloud transport."
msgstr ""
"安装 ``quspect[isingq]`` 后即可向 iSing 提交优化模型。该后端接受二元二次模型和逻辑 Ising "
"问题，不执行量子线路。编译和云端传输都不需要原生扩展。"

#: ../../source/isingq.rst:10
msgid "Compile without submitting"
msgstr "仅编译不提交"

#: ../../source/isingq.rst:21
msgid ""
"The uploaded CSV is upper triangular and minimizes ``x.T @ Q @ x``. "
"Conversion preserves the original variable order and constants. Logical "
"spins use ``s = 2x - 1``; maximization negates the uploaded coefficients."
" Decoding evaluates the original objective independently of the "
"provider's reported energy. Do not upload ``HardwareIsingProgram.matrix``"
" unchanged: its ``-s.T @ M @ s`` convention is different."
msgstr ""
"上传的 CSV 是上三角矩阵，最小化 ``x.T @ Q @ x``。转换保留原始变量顺序和常数项。逻辑自旋采用 ``s = 2x - "
"1``；最大化问题会对上传的系数取负。解码时独立于服务商报告的能量，直接计算原始目标函数。不要原样上传 "
"``HardwareIsingProgram.matrix``：它采用的 ``-s.T @ M @ s`` 约定与此不同。"

#: ../../source/isingq.rst:28
msgid ""
"For a symbolic ``QuadraticProgram``, first call ``compile_program`` and "
"pass its ``model`` to ``compile_isingq``. Keep that compilation result to"
" call ``is_feasible`` and ``evaluate_objective`` on returned bits. The "
"uploaded model includes penalties; the cloud result alone cannot "
"establish constraint feasibility or global optimality."
msgstr ""
"对于符号化的 ``QuadraticProgram``，先调用 ``compile_program``，再将其 ``model`` 传给 "
"``compile_isingq``。保留该编译结果，以便对返回的比特调用 ``is_feasible`` 和 "
"``evaluate_objective``。上传的模型包含惩罚项；仅凭云端结果无法确认约束可行性或全局最优性。"

#: ../../source/isingq.rst:35
msgid "Submit and recover"
msgstr "提交与恢复"

#: ../../source/isingq.rst:37
msgid ""
"The following submit call creates a real hardware task and may consume "
"quota or credit. Supply the key explicitly from your credential store; "
"never save it in a job reference."
msgstr "下面的提交调用会创建真实的硬件任务，并可能消耗配额或额度。请从凭据存储中显式提供密钥；切勿将其保存在任务引用中。"

#: ../../source/isingq.rst:51
msgid ""
"Polling is a separate read and can be resumed in a new client. "
"``calculate_count`` is the vendor's calculation count, not circuit shots "
"or a promise of that many returned samples. The API returns a best "
"vector, not a frequency distribution. The SDK does not automatically "
"retry submission. An ``IsingQError`` with ``submission_outcome == "
"\"unknown\"`` requires reconciliation with the provider before starting "
"another run. Failures before creation use ``not_created``. Polling "
"failures use ``not_applicable``: retry the read using the saved task ID, "
"never treat a read failure as evidence that submission failed."
msgstr ""
"轮询是独立的读取操作，可以在新的客户端中恢复。``calculate_count`` 是服务商的计算次数，不是线路 "
"shots，也不保证返回同样数量的样本。API 返回的是一个最优向量，而不是频率分布。SDK 不会自动重试提交。若 ``IsingQError``"
" 的 ``submission_outcome == \"unknown\"``，必须先与服务商核对，再开始新的运行。任务创建之前的失败使用 "
"``not_created``。轮询失败使用 ``not_applicable``：请使用已保存的任务 ID "
"重试读取，切勿把读取失败当作提交失败的证据。"

#: ../../source/isingq.rst:60
msgid ""
"A create request that the provider answers with an HTTP client error (for "
"example 400, 401, 403 or 404) is a definite refusal and uses ``rejected``: "
"no task exists, and ``status_code`` and ``provider_message`` on the error "
"say why. Timeouts, conflicts and throttling (408, 409, 425, 429), server "
"errors and an answer without a task ID stay ``unknown``. "
"``provider_message`` is the provider's own text with credentials and URLs "
"removed; show it to the user, do not parse it. A failed ``poll`` snapshot "
"carries the same field when the provider explained the failure."
msgstr ""
"若服务商以 HTTP 客户端错误（例如 400、401、403 或 404）回应创建请求，这是明确的拒绝，使用 "
"``rejected``：任务不存在，错误对象上的 ``status_code`` 与 ``provider_message`` "
"说明原因。超时、冲突与限流（408、409、425、429）、服务端错误以及不含任务 ID 的应答仍为 "
"``unknown``。``provider_message`` 是服务商自己的说明文字，已去除凭据和 "
"URL；请把它展示给用户，不要解析它。服务商说明了失败原因时，失败的 ``poll`` 快照也带有同名字段。"

#: ../../source/isingq.rst:70
msgid "Cloud limitations"
msgstr "云端限制"

#: ../../source/isingq.rst:72
msgid ""
"The adapter follows the published ``plectrum-core`` 0.1.2 and ``isingq-"
"toolkit`` 0.5.0 protocol. It uses bounded HTTPS requests and sends only "
"temporary OSS form credentials to the upload host. API account "
"credentials remain on the API origin. There is no public device discovery"
" or cancellation contract. ``computer_type_id`` is a vendor routing "
"value, not proof of which physical machine executes a job. ``gear`` is "
"not exposed because the published cloud implementation does not send it. "
"Coefficient quantization and its admissible ranges remain provider-"
"defined; this adapter does not silently round coefficients or claim exact"
" hardware energy equivalence."
msgstr ""
"该适配器遵循已发布的 ``plectrum-core`` 0.1.2 与 ``isingq-toolkit`` 0.5.0 协议。它使用有界的 "
"HTTPS 请求，只向上传主机发送临时 OSS 表单凭据；API 账户凭据只发送到 API "
"源站。目前没有公开的设备发现或取消任务约定。``computer_type_id`` "
"是服务商的路由值，不能证明任务由哪台物理机器执行。``gear`` "
"未对外暴露，因为已发布的云端实现并不发送该参数。系数量化及其允许范围仍由服务商定义；本适配器不会静默舍入系数，也不声称与硬件能量严格等价。"

#: ../../source/isingq.rst:82
msgid ""
"Since November 2026 the upload signature names a directory (``dir``), and "
"the provider's storage policy only admits object keys under it. The client "
"uploads to ``<dir><random>/quspect-qubo.csv``; the random segment keeps two "
"submissions apart even when the provider signs the same directory twice. A "
"signature without ``dir`` keeps the earlier ``<random>/quspect-qubo.csv`` "
"key."
msgstr ""
"自 2026 年 11 月起，上传签名会指定一个目录（``dir``），服务商的存储策略只接受该目录下的对象键。客户端上传到 "
"``<dir><random>/quspect-qubo.csv``；即使服务商两次签发同一个目录，随机段也能把两次提交区分开。不含 "
"``dir`` 的签名沿用原来的 ``<random>/quspect-qubo.csv`` 键。"

#: ../../source/isingq.rst:88
msgid ""
"The conversion and transport are covered by exhaustive small-model "
"identities and mocked protocol tests. Live account acceptance is a "
"separate deployment check."
msgstr "转换与传输由小规模模型的穷举恒等式测试和模拟协议测试覆盖。真实账户验收是单独的部署检查。"

